id: MOD18-1
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: module_path_overlap
target: crates/core/src/entry_derive.rs
find:                 if crate::instance::owner_in(instances, &at.step) == *owner =>
replace:                 if { let _ = (instances, owner); true } =>
expect-fail: mod18_restore_keeps_shared_path_the_owner_did_not_write
note: 復帰が宛先の持ち主を見ず、保存の後に書かれたすべての経路を戻す（持ち主が書いていない共有の経路まで巻き戻る）
